  "50358562": {
   "id": 50358562,
   "title": "Safari introduces Adaptive Dark Mode in 27.3",
   "url": "https://webkit.org/blog/18541/introducing-adaptive-dark-mode/",
   "domain": "webkit.org",
   "hn_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50358562",
   "is_hn_post": false,
   "by": "paddingtone",
   "posted_at": "2026-11-03T21:39:05+00:00",
   "first_seen": "2026-11-04T15:11:31+00:00",
   "title_zh": "Safari 27.3 推出自適應深色模式",
   "summary_zh": "WebKit 團隊在 Safari 27.3 Beta 版中推出「自適應深色模式（Adaptive Dark Mode）」，能自動將未針對深色外觀優化的淺色網站轉換為深色風格。該功能藉由瀏覽器引擎層級的演算法分析色彩、調和對比度並反轉 SVG 與向量標誌，確保畫面符合無障礙標準（WCAG）對比規範且不損害圖檔呈現。",
